type: text
aliases: ban, bans, hypixel, ac

---

Geyser does not perfectly replicate a Java client; anticheat can pick up irregular behavior from Geyser and trigger an event from the anticheat. For personal servers, not all anticheats will work properly with Geyser. Please take a look at our anticheat compatibility page [here](https://geysermc.org/wiki/geyser/anticheat-compatibility/). Please exercise caution when going on large servers, **especially Hypixel**, since they can pick up irregular behavior from Geyser and ban you. 
